The internal governing corpus of NEUMA is maintained separately in its designated System of Record. Public material in this repository does not automatically replace or relicense that internal corpus.

This notice is intended to prevent accidental over-licensing while the public licensing architecture is finalized. It is not legal advice and does not itself create rights beyond any explicit license attached to a specific asset.